**std_include.hpp does shared Windows/CRT/stdlib setup for project translation units.**

## Configuration

`WIN32_LEAN_AND_MEAN` trims `Windows.h`; `min` and `max` macros are undefined; MSVC warnings 4005, 4091, 4100, 4244, 4389, 4702, 4800, 4996, 5054, 6001, 6011, 6031, 6255, 6258, 6386, 6387, and 26812 are disabled.

## Dependencies

`Windows.h`, `MsHTML.h`, `MsHtmHst.h`, `ExDisp.h`, `WinSock2.h`, `WS2tcpip.h`, GSL, STL headers, `resource.hpp`, and `version.hpp` are included; `gdiplus.lib` and `ws2_32.lib` are linked.

## Interface

`std_include.hpp` exports no functions, classes, types, or constants; `std::literals` is imported globally.